        "TileImage": "$($repository db928f7b-bf66-4b43-82aa-e79b8a788e76).Image",
        "Description": "March 13, 2010, Bratislava, Slovakia. Good evening 47, you have just been the sports presenter of the year 2009, assassin of the year 2009 and as well the Absolute OTO of the year 2009. Your targets are now James Robertson and Jorge Capon. After you eliminate both targets. Meet with either Diana Burnwood or Mária Pietrová at the party. It&apos;s up to you. Good luck 47!\rSources:\rhttps://www.topky.sk/cl/15/689031/Nominacie-OTO-2009--Tito-sa-pobiju-o-sosky-",
